<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Dear {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for expressing interest in the psychology master's program at Arizona State University. The Master of Science in Psychology is an intensive research-oriented program offering students an opportunity to learn in state-of-the art laboratory, computing and classroom spaces. The program is ideal for students who plant to continue on to a doctoral program in psychology or to pursue a career involving psychological research methods, such as marketing research, education research analysis, public policy analysis, research project management or program evaluation.&nbsp; For more information about the program feel free to review the <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/sites/default/files/advising/documents/ms_program_handbook_2016_1.2.pdf">MSP Program Handbook</a>.<br><br>Be sure to review our&nbsp;<a target="_blank" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B44BICxe1BtdSkJZR2xmM0libjg/view?usp=sharing ">application checklist</a> for more information about the application process in an easy to follow format, and peruse our <a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B91ycyfLEFl7Sl9ldm9lZnVoeEk">sample schedule</a><b> </b>to explore the flexible curriculum available for both full-time and part-time students. Also, please take a moment to check out our new <a href="http://links.asu.edu/xqkbm">e-magazine</a> and see all the exciting work being done by our faculty and students.<br><br>It's important to find the right fit in graduate school. A great way to learn more about this degree is to register for one of our upcoming information sessions. You can review the dates <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fnewcollege.asu.edu%2Fadmissions%2Fgraduate-student%23info-sessions&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNG3eyBeebKJl5UB8G4D0hhOqUBSSA">here</a>, then email me to RSVP for any date you plan to attend.<br><br>Kindest regards,<br>Graduate Studies<br><br>New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences<br><font color="#660000">Arizona State University, West campus<br><font color="#000000"><a href="mailto:nc.gradstudies@asu.edu">nc.gradstudies@asu.edu</a><br><br><br><font color="#C0C0C0">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font><br></font></font><br>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>